{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35827","headline":"和人湘中作 · 李咸用","name":"和人湘中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘川湘岸两荒凉，孤雁号空动旅肠。\n一棹寒波思范蠡，满尊醇酒忆陶唐。\n年华蒲柳凋衰鬓，身迹萍蓬滞别乡。\n不及东流趋广汉，臣心日夜与天长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35827.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35827","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}